      "note": "Runs on OpenRouter (one key for many models); the adapter has run against the live API with GPT Image 2.5, this model not yet. The pictures go inline in the request to OpenRouter, which passes them to OpenAI. No mask input on OpenRouter: the mask goes along as a second picture and the prompt says what it means; the stitch keeps the selection anyway. An edit sends no aspect, so the host keeps the crop's shape as its own edit endpoint does (not verified); an answer of another shape is centre-cropped. There is no size parameter: the host picks the output size (OpenRouter's one example is GPT Image 2 at 16:9 and high quality: 1536 x 864; no size is stated for other models or qualities). No transparent background: OpenRouter lists only auto and opaque for this model."
    },
