      "note": "Runs on Oxen.ai (one key for many models); not run against the live API yet (written from Oxen's docs and model list, 2026-09-26). The pictures go inline (data URLs, which Oxen's docs allow but do not recommend for production) in the request to Oxen.ai, which runs the model or passes it on; Oxen keeps every generated image in your Oxen account, and its terms could not be read, so how long it keeps what you send is not stated. Inpainting with the selection as mask (mask_url, white = repaint; it must match the crop's size). The edit asks for aspect \"auto\", which should keep the crop's shape (not verified). An answer of another shape is centre-cropped. Resolution is the answer's tier; on auto the smallest that covers the crop. At most sixteen pictures (the crop, Original and the reference layers). List price $0.004 to $1.13 by quality and resolution (2026-09-26)."
